WEBVTT

00:00:13.090 --> 00:00:15.910
Give Mikono back!

00:00:15.910 --> 00:00:19.010
Infinity Punch!

00:00:22.160 --> 00:00:23.790
Infinity, you say?

00:00:32.620 --> 00:00:34.310
He has an Infinity Punch, too?

00:00:34.310 --> 00:00:35.970
But it's different!

00:00:43.760 --> 00:00:45.490
His arms are following his punches!

00:00:45.490 --> 00:00:47.310
The effect comes before the cause!

00:00:47.750 --> 00:00:50.570
Are those punches violating the laws of causality?

00:00:50.570 --> 00:00:54.930
A mere dog with wings dare speak of infinity? Ridiculous!

00:00:54.930 --> 00:00:57.420
Infinity is a power of God.

00:00:57.420 --> 00:01:03.080
The power to appear at any place and bless at any time.

00:02:51.800 --> 00:02:52.810
Where am I?

00:02:57.020 --> 00:03:05.040
Silvie!

00:03:14.870 --> 00:03:16.420
Why can't I reach her?

00:03:16.940 --> 00:03:20.560
Why can't I reach you, Silvie?

00:03:25.770 --> 00:03:27.280
Damn it!

00:03:34.520 --> 00:03:40.520
This Union is making Amata suffer.

00:03:40.900 --> 00:03:42.220
Who're you?

00:03:42.220 --> 00:03:44.750
This is the labyrinth of Mikage's mind.

00:03:46.100 --> 00:03:49.280
Please, kill me.

00:03:49.280 --> 00:03:49.290
What?
Please, kill me.

00:03:49.290 --> 00:03:50.350
What?

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:56.440
If I die, Mikage won't be able to control the Wings of the Sun.

00:03:57.940 --> 00:04:00.220
It's what I get for being so stupid.

00:04:00.760 --> 00:04:05.180
I can't think of any other way to stop Mikage.

00:04:05.180 --> 00:04:08.740
Amata's going to suffer if he loses Mikono.

00:04:09.850 --> 00:04:12.060
I don't want Amata to suffer.

00:04:23.900 --> 00:04:25.130
Please.

00:04:38.960 --> 00:04:40.940
I can't take any more!

00:04:40.940 --> 00:04:43.090
The Union's about to break!

00:04:47.540 --> 00:04:49.390
How dare you!

00:04:53.650 --> 00:04:57.060
Goodbye, Amata...

00:05:00.870 --> 00:05:02.070
Can't do it.

00:05:06.040 --> 00:05:07.070
Why?

00:05:07.570 --> 00:05:12.330
You don't deserve to get killed over the likes of Amata.

00:05:15.080 --> 00:05:17.710
Pathetic Wingless!

00:05:17.710 --> 00:05:21.550
I no longer need your body!

00:05:28.590 --> 00:05:36.580
The true Wings of the Sun were wielded by the gods of old one by one.

00:05:37.520 --> 00:05:40.610
Now that they have been awakened,

00:05:41.010 --> 00:05:45.110
the cursed bride and I are all the Elements it needs.

00:05:48.070 --> 00:05:49.560
Reverse!

00:05:49.560 --> 00:05:50.660
Contrary Twister!

00:05:55.670 --> 00:05:59.540
Now hear the wedding bells of revenge!

00:06:08.430 --> 00:06:11.430
He rewrote the future?!

00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:20.980
I will take this harlot's body and forge a new world as the God of Genesis!

00:06:29.690 --> 00:06:33.120
Awaken, the other Sun!

00:06:47.390 --> 00:06:49.380
Cayenne! Yunoha!

00:06:57.920 --> 00:06:59.530
A dark sun!

00:07:11.350 --> 00:07:13.530
The temperature is rising all over the world!

00:07:13.910 --> 00:07:18.160
Sea levels all around the world are dropping!

00:07:18.510 --> 00:07:24.170
The Wings of the Sun has become a scorching flame to dry up the planet!

00:07:25.770 --> 00:07:26.960
Mix!

00:07:29.110 --> 00:07:30.680
The whole planet's going to die!

00:07:31.210 --> 00:07:34.180
But we don't stand a chance with just Vectors!

00:07:35.510 --> 00:07:37.430
Amata! Let's Union!

00:07:38.380 --> 00:07:39.790
Andy!

00:07:39.790 --> 00:07:41.950
It's been a long time, Amata!

00:07:41.950 --> 00:07:44.420
Mix! You're back!

00:07:47.820 --> 00:07:50.100
This song! Impossible!

00:07:50.100 --> 00:07:51.200
Shrade!

00:07:55.230 --> 00:07:58.040
It's confirmed to be the Vector Shrade was last in!

00:07:58.040 --> 00:08:00.120
But there don't seem to be any life signs...

00:08:02.840 --> 00:08:04.790
Detecting another Vector!

00:08:04.790 --> 00:08:07.920
It's the one Zessica was piloting before!

00:08:08.880 --> 00:08:10.920
Now we've got two spare Vectors!

00:08:10.920 --> 00:08:13.430
If we can just find one more...

00:08:13.430 --> 00:08:16.930
Yo! You didn't forget about me, did you?

00:08:17.460 --> 00:08:19.430
Vector Z, Malloy, reporting in!

00:08:19.430 --> 00:08:24.810
I'm from the south, you know! The scorching sun and I are buddies!

00:08:25.830 --> 00:08:27.570
We have three Vectors free now!

00:08:27.570 --> 00:08:30.320
Cayenne, Yunoha, redeploy!

00:08:30.320 --> 00:08:32.100
And Element Change!

00:08:32.100 --> 00:08:34.820
Switch out Malloy... for me!

00:08:35.950 --> 00:08:37.590
Chairman Crea!

00:08:37.590 --> 00:08:40.080
Don't be rash! If you need a pilot, I'll go!

00:08:40.080 --> 00:08:44.720
Donar, Suomi. You two must survive.

00:08:44.720 --> 00:08:48.840
If worse comes to worst, you two will be the Adam and Eve of the next generation.

00:08:48.840 --> 00:08:50.110
Wha—?

00:08:50.840 --> 00:08:53.510
Yes, Ma'am! Understood!

00:08:55.840 --> 00:08:59.350
Cayenne! Yunoha! Follow me!

00:08:59.350 --> 00:09:00.430
Roger!

00:09:01.130 --> 00:09:02.810
Good luck!

00:09:08.280 --> 00:09:10.820
This song! Shrade!

00:09:22.130 --> 00:09:26.780
Can you fill my seat? I wonder.

00:09:29.090 --> 00:09:31.090
I entrust it to you, my friend.

00:09:31.860 --> 00:09:33.110
Shrade...

00:09:38.140 --> 00:09:43.090
I want to defend both Jin's homeworld and the Earth!

00:09:43.890 --> 00:09:48.900
Shrade! Your spirit stayed to fight with us!

00:09:48.900 --> 00:09:50.650
Come! Let us fight!

00:09:51.110 --> 00:09:52.650
For our precious friends!

00:09:53.020 --> 00:09:54.490
For our precious partners!

00:09:55.880 --> 00:09:57.490
For our precious ones!

00:09:57.490 --> 00:09:59.490
For our precious feelings!

00:10:02.290 --> 00:10:04.170
Come with me, Shrade.

00:10:05.920 --> 00:10:07.700
Dear Friends Union!

00:10:07.700 --> 00:10:10.420
Go, Aquarion!

00:10:19.300 --> 00:10:21.300
I feel it...

00:10:21.300 --> 00:10:24.310
I feel my friend's soul right beside me!

00:10:24.910 --> 00:10:27.020
Yes, I feel it too...

00:10:27.020 --> 00:10:30.520
The melodies of your soul and everybody else's!

00:10:30.520 --> 00:10:33.270
And they all connect...

00:10:33.820 --> 00:10:37.310
Filling the emptiness made in our hearts.

00:10:37.310 --> 00:10:38.750
Little by little...

00:10:38.750 --> 00:10:40.280
Step by step...

00:10:40.280 --> 00:10:43.530
This is what Fudo was talking about:

00:10:43.530 --> 00:10:47.540
To transcend time and create a divine tale together!

00:11:03.420 --> 00:11:06.520
Aquarion Geparda!

00:11:06.520 --> 00:11:09.800
Now let us fight together, Cayenne.

00:11:10.520 --> 00:11:11.770
Yes, my friend!

00:11:16.520 --> 00:11:18.530
Pathetic.

00:11:21.200 --> 00:11:22.160
What?

00:11:29.760 --> 00:11:30.830
Very well.

00:11:37.220 --> 00:11:38.860
Now, my friend!

00:11:38.860 --> 00:11:39.840
All right!

00:11:45.070 --> 00:11:46.050
Did that do it?

00:11:47.110 --> 00:11:48.500
You take over now.

00:11:49.070 --> 00:11:50.300
Shrade!

00:11:53.480 --> 00:11:55.130
We're surrounded!

00:11:55.130 --> 00:11:56.230
Teleport!

00:11:58.270 --> 00:11:59.490
Chairman?

00:12:05.440 --> 00:12:07.080
Here we go!

00:12:07.080 --> 00:12:10.120
Hole! Hole! Hole!

00:12:13.920 --> 00:12:15.710
Let's play together!

00:12:15.710 --> 00:12:17.840
The Requiem of Genesis!

00:12:35.380 --> 00:12:37.800
I'm getting too old for this.

00:12:37.800 --> 00:12:38.990
Too old?

00:12:40.110 --> 00:12:41.700
Insolent bugs!

00:12:45.230 --> 00:12:46.910
Spatial Augmentation!

00:12:48.790 --> 00:12:50.910
I can't give up now...

00:12:50.910 --> 00:12:53.590
I can't give up now!

00:12:54.420 --> 00:12:59.040
You suffer and suffer, and yet you still stand...

00:12:59.450 --> 00:13:02.380
Do you really want this harlot so?

00:13:02.380 --> 00:13:05.050
Let me put you out of your misery.

00:13:30.840 --> 00:13:33.950
He's pulling the two planets together by force!

00:13:38.960 --> 00:13:41.840
He's absorbing the life from both worlds!

00:13:50.510 --> 00:13:54.000
You're the ones from 12,000 years ago.

00:13:54.000 --> 00:13:56.770
Yeah. I still remember your smell.

00:13:58.430 --> 00:13:59.480
Apollo!

00:14:00.160 --> 00:14:01.440
Is that you, Apollo?

00:14:05.160 --> 00:14:06.570
There is no need for sorrow,

00:14:07.600 --> 00:14:10.630
my dear future sister.

00:14:11.980 --> 00:14:13.600
Brother!

00:14:13.600 --> 00:14:16.870
Born from Man and Angel,

00:14:16.870 --> 00:14:20.500
my suffering and my salvation.

00:14:22.140 --> 00:14:23.250
Toma!

00:14:27.190 --> 00:14:28.440
I'm sorry.

00:14:28.980 --> 00:14:31.720
I remember now.

00:14:32.270 --> 00:14:33.670
It's all my fault.

00:14:34.350 --> 00:14:37.480
You sacrificed yourselves because of me.

00:14:37.480 --> 00:14:39.340
Do not apologize.

00:14:39.840 --> 00:14:45.460
You did all you could, as did we.

00:14:45.460 --> 00:14:51.990
And hey, we met again, just like we promised.

00:14:53.620 --> 00:14:55.290
Amata! Apollo!

00:14:55.870 --> 00:14:59.560
Because Man and Angel were connected.

00:15:05.880 --> 00:15:12.380
Not just once, but twice, you stole away the one I loved, you harlot!

00:15:14.490 --> 00:15:15.890
Do not fear!

00:15:16.560 --> 00:15:17.980
High Commander Fudo!

00:15:17.980 --> 00:15:23.480
Those are the shadows of Toma's heart, separated from his pure love.

00:15:24.060 --> 00:15:25.560
The shadows of Toma's heart...

00:15:26.360 --> 00:15:27.230
Mikage!

00:15:27.670 --> 00:15:29.640
Do not turn away.

00:15:29.640 --> 00:15:32.360
You must see the rest of this story.

00:15:34.120 --> 00:15:37.280
Overcome your fears and find the truth.

00:15:37.280 --> 00:15:39.760
You are now ready.

00:15:40.670 --> 00:15:42.340
Apollonius...

00:15:42.880 --> 00:15:48.180
Apollonius! Apollonius!

00:15:49.540 --> 00:15:51.760
Apollonius.

00:15:51.760 --> 00:15:56.540
I will burn all you hold dear.

00:16:04.730 --> 00:16:05.900
Mix!

00:16:09.160 --> 00:16:10.240
The Union broke!

00:16:10.740 --> 00:16:12.240
He did that with just one attack!

00:16:17.240 --> 00:16:18.380
Amata!

00:16:18.940 --> 00:16:20.370
Damn it, Mikage!

00:16:20.370 --> 00:16:24.050
Let's give them a hand, bitch!

00:16:26.250 --> 00:16:29.130
You got it, asshole!

00:16:32.650 --> 00:16:34.110
Amata!

00:16:34.110 --> 00:16:35.390
Zessica!

00:16:35.390 --> 00:16:36.840
Kagura!

00:16:36.840 --> 00:16:38.510
Save it for later!

00:16:38.510 --> 00:16:41.120
Let us fight with you!

00:16:41.640 --> 00:16:44.270
For Mikono, and for our world!

00:16:44.270 --> 00:16:45.920
Zessica...

00:16:46.580 --> 00:16:47.690
I'm sorry.

00:16:47.690 --> 00:16:49.510
Don't be stupid, Amata.

00:16:49.510 --> 00:16:51.320
What are you apologizing for?

00:16:52.720 --> 00:16:54.570
Then thank you, Zessica!

00:16:54.570 --> 00:16:57.280
You're a real dumbshit.

00:16:57.280 --> 00:17:00.330
Way to make a bitch cry.

00:17:01.630 --> 00:17:03.350
Let's get 'em, boys!

00:17:03.350 --> 00:17:04.580
Pure Love Union!

00:17:04.580 --> 00:17:05.960
Go!

00:17:05.960 --> 00:17:07.840
Aquarion!

00:17:14.210 --> 00:17:16.570
Kindness within strength!

00:17:16.570 --> 00:17:18.770
Passion within weakness!

00:17:18.770 --> 00:17:20.720
They're so wonderful!

00:17:22.060 --> 00:17:24.810
Aquarion Evol!

00:17:26.510 --> 00:17:28.040
Apollonius...

00:17:28.040 --> 00:17:28.940
What is this?

00:17:29.490 --> 00:17:33.220
Apollonius...

00:17:33.220 --> 00:17:35.820
You loved Apollonius so much...

00:17:35.820 --> 00:17:37.160
Apollonius...

00:17:37.160 --> 00:17:39.310
But you were betrayed and hurt...

00:17:39.310 --> 00:17:40.820
Apollonius...

00:17:40.820 --> 00:17:45.250
Even so... even through all that...

00:17:45.250 --> 00:17:48.750
Apollonius!

00:17:52.110 --> 00:17:52.870
I...

00:17:54.360 --> 00:17:55.850
I love him.

00:17:58.530 --> 00:18:00.120
That's right.

00:18:00.760 --> 00:18:03.560
You... you still...

00:18:05.760 --> 00:18:09.610
So close...

00:18:10.730 --> 00:18:12.400
I'm sorry.

00:18:12.400 --> 00:18:15.110
I never wanted to acknowledge it.

00:18:16.700 --> 00:18:19.820
That I stole your love away.

00:18:20.220 --> 00:18:22.080
That I hurt you so badly.

00:18:22.980 --> 00:18:24.160
It's too late to apologize!

00:18:24.660 --> 00:18:26.620
I don't care what you do to me!

00:18:27.040 --> 00:18:30.580
Just spare all the other people of the world!

00:18:31.160 --> 00:18:33.250
Mikono!

00:18:33.250 --> 00:18:35.010
Amata! Stay away!

00:18:36.380 --> 00:18:38.510
Everyone get away!

00:18:38.510 --> 00:18:41.510
No! I can't leave you behind!

00:18:41.510 --> 00:18:44.380
And I can't let this go!

00:18:45.330 --> 00:18:47.420
I'll connect them!

00:18:47.420 --> 00:18:52.860
I'll connect this soul torn between love and pain back together!

00:18:54.170 --> 00:18:56.900
Enough of this pathetic joke!

00:18:59.800 --> 00:19:01.820
Mikono!

00:19:04.180 --> 00:19:05.740
Reverse!

00:19:08.330 --> 00:19:13.140
Take this! All Together Punch!

00:19:18.840 --> 00:19:22.180
Go!

00:19:25.320 --> 00:19:27.720
Mikono!

00:19:28.840 --> 00:19:29.890
Pathetic!

00:19:34.670 --> 00:19:36.370
We're burning up!

00:19:36.820 --> 00:19:39.240
I'm not giving up yet!

00:19:39.240 --> 00:19:42.820
I let my Mom slip away from me!

00:19:43.160 --> 00:19:45.580
I've regretted that ever since!

00:19:45.930 --> 00:19:47.490
But now I understand!

00:19:48.180 --> 00:19:56.270
That's how Silvia... how Mikono felt 12,000 years ago when I left her!

00:19:56.710 --> 00:20:01.590
I was born again so I could learn that!

00:20:02.750 --> 00:20:05.040
I won't let you slip away from me this time!

00:20:05.040 --> 00:20:07.110
I won't leave you again!

00:20:07.110 --> 00:20:13.230
I want my love, Mikono, to be with me as I fight to save the world!

00:20:13.230 --> 00:20:14.610
Amata!

00:20:15.360 --> 00:20:17.730
Pathetic winged mongrel!

00:20:29.560 --> 00:20:31.820
Is this where it ends?

00:20:31.820 --> 00:20:33.080
Right here?

00:20:33.450 --> 00:20:35.460
Aquarion has disassembled!

00:20:35.460 --> 00:20:38.710
The Elements' health levels are dangerously low!

00:20:39.050 --> 00:20:41.210
Amata and everyone will...

00:20:45.000 --> 00:20:47.720
Amata-kun...

00:20:53.380 --> 00:20:54.980
<i>I want to protect...</i>

00:21:02.110 --> 00:21:03.510
Jin-kun?

00:21:03.510 --> 00:21:04.960
Is it you, Jin-kun?!

00:21:05.560 --> 00:21:07.700
Yonoha, didn't I tell you that nobody is ever alone?

00:21:08.310 --> 00:21:11.970
Jin-kun!

00:21:11.970 --> 00:21:13.120
Yonoha...

00:21:18.290 --> 00:21:21.880
I feel Jin's aura too!

00:21:25.310 --> 00:21:27.930
<i>I feel Jin-kun's heart...</i>

00:21:32.530 --> 00:21:34.530
<i>and the beat of his soul!</i>

00:21:35.050 --> 00:21:37.050
The force of life...

00:21:37.670 --> 00:21:39.610
that flows through everything!

00:21:56.690 --> 00:21:57.830
Amata...

00:21:58.960 --> 00:22:02.220
Amata.

00:22:03.580 --> 00:22:04.740
Amata!

00:22:05.980 --> 00:22:13.360
Amata.

00:22:14.960 --> 00:22:17.670
Accept the present, Amata.

00:22:18.650 --> 00:22:19.760
Amata...

00:22:20.360 --> 00:22:21.470
Amata.

00:22:22.290 --> 00:22:23.270
Mom...

00:22:23.800 --> 00:22:24.810
Dad...

00:22:36.510 --> 00:22:37.290
Amata!

00:22:38.240 --> 00:22:40.500
You're wrong, Mikono!

00:22:40.670 --> 00:22:44.380
You can't connect them by yourself!

00:22:47.200 --> 00:22:49.130
If someone's with you,

00:22:49.130 --> 00:22:51.470
if you share your feelings with someone,

00:22:51.470 --> 00:22:53.140
that's how you connect!

00:22:53.960 --> 00:22:56.770
I'll be with you!

00:23:01.950 --> 00:23:05.030
Whether we grow old and wrinkled together,

00:23:05.440 --> 00:23:08.590
or it ends for us right here as a legend!

00:23:08.590 --> 00:23:10.760
I'll be right there by you!

00:23:11.660 --> 00:23:13.970
We'll fly to infinity!

00:23:13.970 --> 00:23:16.410
I'll love you to infinity!

00:23:21.290 --> 00:23:22.640
Amata!

00:23:22.640 --> 00:23:24.330
You crazy asshole...

00:23:24.330 --> 00:23:30.410
I was reborn to love Silvie, over 12,000 years.

00:23:31.440 --> 00:23:35.930
But you love Mikono now, the way she is.

00:23:38.310 --> 00:23:44.110
So go! Finish this and complete your love!

00:23:45.050 --> 00:23:45.950
Kagura!

00:23:50.760 --> 00:23:52.570
Mikono!

00:23:52.570 --> 00:23:54.320
Amata!

00:23:54.320 --> 00:23:54.330
Genesis Union! Go!
Amata!

00:23:54.330 --> 00:23:57.460
Genesis Union! Go!

00:23:57.460 --> 00:23:59.830
Aquarion Evol!

00:24:04.880 --> 00:24:06.090
What?

00:24:10.300 --> 00:24:11.880
Nope.

00:24:11.880 --> 00:24:13.220
That's not an Evol.

00:24:13.680 --> 00:24:15.970
It has a new name now.

00:24:19.390 --> 00:24:20.890
Aquarion...

00:24:20.890 --> 00:24:22.390
Love!

00:24:25.820 --> 00:24:27.400
Amata!

00:24:27.760 --> 00:24:29.530
Mikono!

00:24:30.110 --> 00:24:33.660
I...

00:24:35.290 --> 00:24:36.870
I love you!

00:24:50.710 --> 00:24:53.880
Get a room, you two...

00:24:58.840 --> 00:25:01.420
Aquarion Love's tears!

00:25:01.420 --> 00:25:05.520
They're crossing space to rain on the parched earth!

00:25:05.520 --> 00:25:09.020
The separated worlds are being united again!

00:25:22.800 --> 00:25:24.070
Curse you...

00:25:24.640 --> 00:25:26.450
This cannot end here.

00:25:27.070 --> 00:25:30.670
I just need a body!

00:25:32.670 --> 00:25:36.180
You!

00:25:40.540 --> 00:25:42.260
Why can't I move?

00:25:42.260 --> 00:25:45.470
Why won't you obey me?

00:25:47.440 --> 00:25:48.920
Apollonius?

00:25:49.490 --> 00:25:52.690
I will accept you into myself.

00:25:54.380 --> 00:25:57.080
Let us watch over this age together.

00:25:57.080 --> 00:26:01.160
Sleep within me, shadow of love.

00:26:02.080 --> 00:26:07.580
After all these eons, we are now together.

00:26:09.360 --> 00:26:13.890
You betrayed me not once, but twice.

00:26:14.970 --> 00:26:16.970
Yet why...

00:26:17.590 --> 00:26:21.940
Why do I feel so warm inside you?

00:27:49.310 --> 00:27:50.230
Shush?

00:28:19.840 --> 00:28:21.550
Amata!

00:28:28.090 --> 00:28:30.680
And now, love is permitted once more!
